  <h2>More Than Just a Logo</h2>
  <p>In the competitive activewear market, branding is what allows you to charge a premium. It's the emotional connection between your product and your customer.</p>
  
  <h3>The Branding Ecosystem</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Heat Transfer Labels:</strong> The standard for "tagless" comfort in activewear.</li>
    <li><strong>Woven Hangtags:</strong> Your first physical touchpoint with the customer. Should reflect your brand's quality.</li>
    <li><strong>Custom Hardware:</strong> Branded zippers, drawcord aglets, and metal clips add a "high-end" feel.</li>
    <li><strong>Sustainable Packaging:</strong> Using compostable bags or recycled boxes shows your commitment to the planet.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Consistency is Key</h3>
  <p>Ensure your brand colors and typography are consistent across every element—from your website to the inside of your leggings. This builds professional trust and recognition.</p>

  <h3>Partnering with Fitclo</h3>
  <p>We provide a complete branding suite. We don't just manufacture the garment; we help you source the perfect labels, tags, and custom packaging to make your brand stand out.</p>
</GuideLayout>
